            "gap": 56,
            "align": "center",
            "columns": [
              {
                "id": "intro_c1",
                "blocks": [
                  {
                    "id": "intro_h",
                    "type": "heading",
                    "level": 1,
                    "eyebrow": "Who we are",
                    "text": "About surzion"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "intro_tag",
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Experience builds vision, and vision creates innovation.",
                    "style": {
                      "textColor": "var(--pg-accent)",
                      "typography": {
                        "fontSize": 20
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "intro_p1",
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "With over 7 years of experience in medical sales and marketing, our journey led us to establish KAPSONS \u2014 a company born from passion and precision."
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "intro_p2",
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "From this journey came SURZION, a brand designed to represent The Surgical Excellence."
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "intro_p3",
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Our instruments, made with 410, 420, and 316-grade stainless steel, as well as tungsten carbide and titanium materials, meet international standards of quality."
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "intro_p4",
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Certified with ISO and CE, we are driven by one mission \u2014 to empower surgeons with reliable and innovative instruments that define perfection."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "intro_c2",
                "blocks": [
